#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-executor.php
msgid "A Redis object-cache activation is already pending verification."
msgstr "Aktivacija Redisove objektnega predpomnilnika že čaka preverjanje."

#: includes/class-yperf-product-progress.php
msgid "A YPerf optimization is enabled and proven"
msgstr "Optimizacija YPerf je omogočena in potrjena."

#: includes/class-yperf-migration-journey.php
msgid "A clean baseline was captured before migration."
msgstr "Pred migracije shranjeno je čisto začetno stanje."

#: includes/class-yperf-ai-advisor.php
msgid ""
"A clean current-version Runtime Acceptance is required before AI-assisted "
"configuration can be applied."
msgstr ""
"Pred uporabo konfiguracije z pomočjo umetne inteligence potrebna je uspešna "
"trenutna preverjanje ustreznosti delovanja."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-operation-contract.php
msgid ""
"A clean current-version Runtime Acceptance is required before the R3 object-"
"cache activation can be approved."
msgstr ""
"Pred odobritve aktivacije objektnega predpomnilnika R3 potrebna je uspešna "
"trenutna preverjanje ustreznosti delovanja."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"A compact guide for the provider workflow. No Cloudflare expertise is "
"required."
msgstr ""
"Kratek vodnik za postopek ponudnika storitve. Poznavanje Cloudflarea ni "
"potrebno."

#: includes/class-yperf-environment-check.php
msgid ""
"A drop-in exists but WordPress did not confirm an active external object "
"cache."
msgstr ""
"Datoteka za vmesniški predpomnilnik obstaja, vendar WordPress ni potrdil, da"
" je zunanji objektni predpomnilnik aktiven."

#: includes/class-yperf-environment-check.php
msgid "A drop-in exists. Ownership must be known before YPerf adopts page caching."
msgstr ""
"Datoteka za predpomnilnik obstaja. Preden YPerf prevzame predpomnjenje "
"strani, mora biti jasno, kdo jo upravlja."

#: includes/class-yperf-environment-check.php
msgid "A feature depending on this extension may be limited."
msgstr "Funkcija ki odvisno o tem razširitvi je lahko omejena."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-campaign.php
msgid ""
"A hot-cache HIT sample failed and automatic rollback could not be confirmed."
" Stop and review the cache artifact before continuing."
msgstr ""
"Vzorec zadetka v ogretem predpomnilniku ni prestal preverjanje, in samodejno"
" povrnitev ni potrjeno. Ustavite postopek in preverite datoteke "
"predpomnilnika."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-campaign.php
msgid ""
"A hot-cache HIT sample failed during stability measurement. The new "
"activation was rolled back automatically."
msgstr ""
"Vzorec zadetka v ogretem predpomnilniku ni prestal preverjanje med merjenja "
"stabilnosti. Nova aktivacija samodejno je razveljavljena."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-campaign.php
msgid ""
"A hot-cache HIT sample failed while re-proving an existing executor. The "
"pre-existing cache was not removed automatically and requires review."
msgstr ""
"Vzorec zadetka v ogretem predpomnilniku ni prestal preverjanje pri ponovni "
"potrdi obstoječega izvajalnika. Prejšnja predpomnilnik ni samodejno "
"odstranjena."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"A local under-the-hood report that combines WordPress, runtime, cache, "
"application and acceptance evidence. Nothing is sent remotely."
msgstr ""
"Lokalno tehnično poročilo ki združuje podatke iz WordPressa, izvajalnega "
"okolja, predpomnilnika, aplikacije in preverjanja ustreznosti."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"A material performance regression repeated on the confirmation pass. YPerf "
"rolled the profile back automatically."
msgstr ""
"Znatno poslabšanje zmogljivosti ponovilo se pri kontrolni preveri. YPerf je "
"samodejno povrnil prejšnji profil."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"A memory engine may be available, but WordPress has not confirmed an adopted"
" persistent object-cache execution layer."
msgstr ""
"Pomnilniški mehanizem morda je na voljo, vendar WordPress ni potrdil uporaba"
" trajne objektnega predpomnilnika."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-campaign.php
msgid ""
"A native page-cache adoption record already exists. YPerf will not activate "
"a second page-cache executor until that authority is reviewed or released."
msgstr ""
"Zapis o prevzemu upravljanja izvornem predpomnilnikom strani že obstaja. "
"YPerf ne bo aktivirati drugi izvajalnik predpomnilnika strani medtem ko se "
"ne razreši obstoječe upravljanje."

#. Extracted from PHP source; i18n unification.
#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-executor.php
msgid ""
"A native page-cache adoption record exists. Release that cache authority "
"explicitly before enabling portable YPerf Page Cache."
msgstr ""
"Obstaja zapis o prevzemu izvorne predpomnilnika strani. Izrecno sprostite tu"
" pooblastilo pred vključevanja prenosljive YPerf predpomnilnika strani."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"A new activation rolls back automatically if cache proof or Runtime "
"Acceptance fails."
msgstr ""
"Nova aktivacija samodejno se razveljavi če preverjanje predpomnilnika ali "
"preverjanje ustreznosti delovanja ne uspe."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"A no-change planning surface built from WordPress evidence plus the optional"
" host snapshot. Explicit execution lives in the dedicated adoption/operation"
" cards and remains gated by ownership, proof and rollback contracts."
msgstr ""
"Načrtovalni pogled brez spreminjanja nastavitev temelji na dokazih "
"WordPressa in neobveznem posnetku stanja strežnika. Izvajanje je na voljo "
"samo v namenskih karticah za prevzem in operacije ter ostaja pogojeno z "
"lastništvom, dokazili in pravili povrnitve."

#. Extracted from PHP source; i18n unification.
#: includes/class-yperf-managed-runtime.php
msgid ""
"A non-YPerf file already uses the managed runtime filename. YPerf will not "
"overwrite it."
msgstr ""
"Datoteka, ki ni del YPerf, že uporablja ime datoteke upravljanega "
"izvajalnega okolja. YPerf je ne bo prepisal."

#: includes/class-yperf-native-page-cache-adoption.php
msgid ""
"A previous adoption record exists, but current proof no longer matches or is"
" stale. Re-prove execution before treating the adoption as current."
msgstr ""
"Obstaja zapis o prejšnjem prevzemu, vendar se trenutni dokazi ne ujemajo več"
" ali so zastareli. Preden prevzem obravnavate kot aktualen, ponovno "
"preverite izvajanje."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"A provider-owned advanced-cache.php can still block blind manual removal. "
"The transactional handover deactivates the provider first, reconciles YPerf "
"ownership, proves execution, and automatically restores the previous "
"provider if proof fails."
msgstr ""
"Datoteka advanced-cache.php v upravljanju drugega ponudnika lahko prepreči "
"nepremišljeno ročno odstranitev. Pri nadzorovani predaji YPerf najprej "
"deaktivira ponudnika, preveri upravljanje datoteke, potrdi delovanje in ob "
"neuspešnem preverjanju samodejno obnovi prejšnjega ponudnika."

msgid ""
"A provider-owned advanced-cache.php can still block blind removal. YPerf "
"prepares a reversible handoff, but you control W3 Total Cache activation on "
"the normal Plugins screen. After your confirmation, YPerf reconciles "
"ownership and proves the replacement."
msgstr ""
"Datoteka advanced-cache.php v upravljanju ponudnika lahko prepreči "
"nepremišljeno odstranitev. YPerf pripravi povratno predajo, vendar "
"aktivacijo W3 Total Cache upravljate sami na običajni strani Vtičniki. Po "
"potrditvi YPerf preveri upravljanje in delovanje nadomestne datoteke."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"A read-only site health check. It verifies public routes, cache safety and "
"origin behavior without changing settings."
msgstr ""
"Preverjanje zdravja spletnega mesta samo za branje. Preverja javne poti, "
"varnost predpomnilnika in vedenje izvornega strežnika brez sprememb "
"nastavitev."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"A score is diagnostic evidence, not a cache engine. YPerf should explain why"
" a page is slow and which layer owns the cost."
msgstr ""
"Ocena je diagnostičen kazalnik, in ne mehanizem predpomnilnika. YPerf treba "
"pojasniti zakaj je strani počasna in ki plast lahko rešiti težava."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "A second pass prevents one noisy sample from triggering rollback by itself."
msgstr ""
"Drugi prehod preprečuje da en nezanesljiv vzorec sem izzive povrnitev "
"sprememba."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"A technical map of YPerf and detected acceleration layers. Use Optimize or "
"Settings for normal on/off control."
msgstr ""
"Tehnični pregled YPerfa in odkritih plasti pospeševanja. Za običajno "
"vključitev in izključitev uporabite Optimizacijo ali Nastavitve."

