#: includes/class-yperf-recommendations.php
msgid ""
"Redis is reachable and fast, but host evidence shows meaningful eviction "
"pressure. Verify existing consumers, database/prefix isolation and memory "
"budget before adding WordPress object-cache load."
msgstr ""
"Redis je dosegljiv in hiter, vendar dokazi strežnika kažejo opazen pritisk "
"zaradi izrivanja podatkov. Pred dodatno obremenitvijo WordPressovega "
"objektnega predpomnilnika preverite obstoječe porabnike, izolacijo "
"podatkovne baze oziroma predpone in pomnilniški proračun."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"Redis is reachable but under eviction/memory pressure; adding a new consumer"
" is intentionally blocked pending ownership review."
msgstr ""
"Redis je na voljo, vendar pod pritiskom pomnilnika ali izločanja; dodajanje "
"novega porabnikov namerno je blokirano do pregleda lastništva."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-adoption.php
msgid ""
"Redis is reachable, bounded, below the adoption pressure threshold and an "
"empty logical database is available. R1 can reserve the target locally; "
"R2/R3 then require a fresh contract and explicit activation approval."
msgstr ""
"Redis je dosegljiv in omejen, pomnilniški pritisk je pod pragom za prevzem, "
"na voljo pa je prazna logična podatkovna baza. R1 lahko lokalno rezervira "
"cilj; R2 in R3 nato zahtevata novo pogodbo in izrecno odobritev aktivacije."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Redis isolation & adoption readiness"
msgstr "Redis izolacija in pripravljenost za prevzem"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
