msgid ""
"Redis maxmemory is not bounded. YPerf will not prepare WordPress object-"
"cache adoption until a reviewed memory boundary exists."
msgstr ""
"Redis maxmemory ni omejen. YPerf ne bo pripraviti prevzem WordPressove "
"objektnega predpomnilnika medtem ko ne obstaja pregledana pomnilniška meja."

