"The YPerf-owned portable Page Cache already owns page-cache execution. "
"Native Nginx adoption stays locked so the site never runs two competing "
"page-cache authorities."
msgstr ""
"Prenosljiva predpomnilnik strani v upravljanju YPerf že upravlja izvajanjem "
"predpomnilnika. Prevzem izvorne Nginx predpomnilnika ostaja zaklenjeno kako "
"spletno mesto nikoli ne bi imalo dva konkurentska upravitelja."

msgid "The YPerf-owned replacement must pass before migration can finalize."
msgstr ""
"Nadomestna komponenta, ki jo upravlja YPerf, mora uspešno prestati "
"preverjanje, preden se migracija lahko zaključi."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
