msgid ""
"The account API key authenticates optional Yablonsky AI remote compute. It "
"is not a plugin license and never unlocks local YPerf functionality. "
"External requests happen only after an explicit administrator action."
msgstr ""
"Ključ API računa omogoča preverjanje pristnosti za neobvezno oddaljeno "
"računanje Yablonsky AI. Ni licenca vtičnika in nikoli ne odklene lokalnih "
"funkcij YPerf. Zunanji zahtevki se pošljejo samo po izrecnem dejanju "
"skrbnika."

#: includes/class-yperf-native-page-cache-operations.php
msgid ""
"The adopted cache zone is used by more than one Nginx server block. YPerf "
"will not prepare a zone-wide purge path that could affect another site."
msgstr ""
"Prevzeto območje predpomnilnika uporablja več Nginx poslužiteljskih blokov. "
"YPerf ne bo pripraviti praznjenje celotne območja ki bi lahko utjecati na "
"drugo spletno mesto."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The audit is ready and will keep the 50 most recent semantic invalidation "
"requests."
msgstr ""
"Revizija je pripravljena in zadržavat bo 50 najnovijih zahtevkov za "
"semantično razveljavitev predpomnilnika."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The baseline was rolled back after proof detected a failure or confirmed "
"regression."
msgstr ""
"Začetne nastavitve razveljavljene so potem ko je preverjanje otkrila neuspeh"
" ali potrjeno poslabšanje."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "The bundled Host Inspector file is missing or unreadable."
msgstr "Priložena datoteka Host Inspector manjka ali ni berljiva."

#: includes/class-yperf-native-page-cache-operations.php
msgid "The cache zone is visible, but its server-block ownership is not proven yet."
msgstr ""
"Območje predpomnilnika je vidna, vendar lastništvo njena strežniškega bloka "
"še ni potrjeno."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "The campaign changes only the YPerf-owned portable Page Cache boundary."
msgstr ""
"Kampanja spreminja samo mejo prenosljive predpomnilnika strani v upravljanju"
" YPerf."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The contract preserves an explicit admin worker reserve and records the "
"exact before-state. R3 can adopt an already-safe native max_children limit "
"without rewriting PHP-FPM; any future host rewrite still requires syntax "
"test, read-back, Runtime Acceptance and rollback."
msgstr ""
"Pogodba o izvajanju ohranja izrecno rezervo skrbniških delovnih procesov in "
"zabeleži natančno predhodno stanje. R3 lahko prevzame že varno izvorno "
"omejitev max_children brez spreminjanja PHP-FPM. Vsaka poznejša sprememba "
"konfiguracije strežnika še vedno zahteva preverjanje skladnje, ponovno "
"branje nastavitev, preverjanje ustreznosti delovanja in možnost povrnitve."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-adoption.php
