"The current YPerf Runtime Acceptance is missing, stale or contains a "
"functional failure. Control-plane capacity is not considered releasable "
"until the site baseline is clean."
msgstr ""
"Trenutno preverjanje delovanja YPerf manjka, je zastarelo ali vsebuje "
"funkcionalno napako. Uvedba sprememb ni pripravljena, dokler ni uspešno "
"opravljeno novo preverjanje."

