msgstr ""
"Trenutno zgodaj izvajalno okolje YPerfa mora prestati preverjanje pred "
"spremembe Video Litea."

msgid ""
"The current YPerf early runtime must pass before media optimization can be "
"changed."
msgstr ""
"Trenutno zgodaj izvajalno okolje YPerfa mora prestati preverjanje pred "
"spremembe optimizacije medija."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
