msgstr "Zaključana Redis baza ali prostor imena ključev ni veljaven."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The handover button unlocks automatically after Step 4 proves that all "
"active provider responsibilities have a safe path."
msgstr ""
"Gumb predaje samodejno se odklene potem ko 4. korak potrdi varen pot za vse "
"aktivne odgovornosti ponudnika."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The helper is bundled with this exact YPerf release. It does not install "
"packages, edit configuration, restart services, scan Redis keys or export "
"raw server configuration."
msgstr ""
"Pomočnik je priložen upravo tem izdaji YPerfa. Ne namesti pakete, ne ureja "
"konfiguracijo, ne ponovno zažene servise, ne skenira Redis ključe in ne "
"izvozi sirovu konfiguracijo strežnika."

#: includes/class-yperf-settings-transfer.php
msgid "The imported configuration failed the final Health Check."
msgstr "Uvožena konfiguracija ni prestala završnu preverjanje zdravja."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-executor.php
msgid ""
"The installed YPerf Page Cache artifact is not in the reviewed compatibility"
" chain."
msgstr "Nameščeni artefakt Page Cache YPerf ni del preverjene verige združljivosti."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"The legacy advanced-cache.php is unexpectedly large, so YPerf refused "
"automatic cleanup."
msgstr ""
"Stara datoteka advanced-cache.php je nepričakovano velika, zato je YPerf "
"zavrnil samodejno čiščenje."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"The legacy advanced-cache.php no longer has high-confidence W3 Total Cache "
"ownership."
msgstr ""
"Za prejšnjo datoteko advanced-cache.php več ni dovolj zanesljivo ugotovljeno"
" lastništvo W3 Total Cachea."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid "The legacy drop-in could not be captured safely, so nothing was removed."
msgstr ""
"Prejšnje datoteke drop-in ni bilo mogoče varno zajeti, zato ni bilo nič "
"odstranjeno."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"The legacy provider is inactive, its owned advanced-cache.php is retired, "
"and post-cleanup Runtime Acceptance is clean."
msgstr ""
"Prejšnji ponudnik je neaktiven, njegova datoteka advanced-cache.php je "
"odstranjena, preverjanje delovanja po čiščenju pa je uspešno."

msgid ""
"The live YPerf Page Cache hash differs from the stored authority record. "
"Repair is blocked for review."
msgstr ""
"Kontrolni povzetek aktivne YPerf predpomnilnika strani razlikuje se od "
"spremljenog zapisa pooblastila. Popravilo je blokiran deluje pregleda."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-executor.php
msgid ""
"The loaded YPerf drop-in did not prove its own Redis connection, database "
"and namespace."
msgstr ""
"Naložena datoteka drop-in YPerf ni potrdila lastne povezave z Redisom, "
"podatkovne zbirke in imenskega prostora."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-executor.php
msgid "The loaded object-cache drop-in does not match the approved artifact hash."
msgstr ""
"Naložena datoteka objektnega predpomnilnika ne ustreza odobreni zgoščeni "
"vrednosti artefakta."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The local YPerf profile is proven, but no page-cache executor is active yet."
" Run the bounded Page Cache stability campaign to prove MISS → HIT, Runtime "
"safety and repeat-HIT consistency before moving deeper into Redis or Origin "
"tuning."
msgstr ""
"Lokalni profil YPerf je potrjen, vendar izvajalnik predpomnilnika strani še "
"ni aktiven. Zaženite omejeno kampanjo stabilnosti predpomnilnika strani, da "
"pred nadaljnjim nastavljanjem Redis ali izvornega strežnika preverite MISS →"
" HIT, varnost delovanja in doslednost ponovljenih zadetkov HIT."

#: includes/class-yperf-ai-advisor.php
msgid ""
"The local YPerf safety gate lowered the AI profile because current "
"deterministic evidence does not authorize the requested level."
msgstr ""
"Lokalna YPerf varnostna preverjanje smanjila je AI profil ker trenutni "
"deterministično dokazi ne dopuštaju traženu raven."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "The local profile was applied and accepted by Runtime Acceptance."
msgstr "Lokalni profil uporabljen je in sprejet z preverjanjem ustreznosti delovanja."

#: includes/class-yperf-release-readiness.php
msgid ""
"The local runtime/control-plane gates are healthy. Official WordPress Plugin"
" Check remains an external human acceptance gate and is never fabricated "
"from inside YPerf."
msgstr ""
"Lokalne preverjanja delovanja in upravljavskega plasti uspešne so. Uradni "
"WordPress Plugin Check ostaja zunanja preverjanje katero potrjuje človek in "
"YPerf je nikoli ne izmišlja."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"The log is local, bounded and intended for debugging invalidation storms and"
" unexpected cache churn."
msgstr ""
"Dnevnik je lokalan, omejen in namijenjen diagnostiki oluja razveljavljanja "
"in neočekivanih sprememba predpomnilnika."

