#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The model catalog comes from the verified account plan; YPerf does not ship "
"a frozen provider list."
msgstr ""
"Katalog modela dolazi iz potrjenega paketa računa; YPerf ne dostavlja "
"zamrznuti seznam ponudnika."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The model requested a broader profile than current deterministic evidence "
"allows. YPerf lowered it before any Apply became possible."
msgstr ""
"Model je zahteval širi profil kot kar dopuštaju trenutni deterministično "
"dokazi. YPerf ga je smanjio preden je Uporabi postalo na voljo."

#: includes/class-yperf-native-page-cache-operations.php
msgid ""
"The native executor is adopted, but current-version Runtime Acceptance must "
"be clean before an operation plan can advance."
msgstr ""
"Izvorni izvajalnik preuzet je, vendar trenutna preverjanje ustreznosti "
"delovanja mora biti uspešna pred nadaljevanjem operativnog načrta."

#: includes/class-yperf-native-page-cache-adoption.php
msgid ""
"The native proof belongs to a different hostname, so YPerf will not adopt it"
" for this site."
msgstr ""
"Izvorna potrditev pripada drugem imenu strežnika pa je YPerf ne bo prevzeti "
"za to spletno mesto."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid "The new YPerf-owned runtime must pass before migration can finalize."
msgstr ""
"Novo izvajalno okolje v upravljanju YPerf mora uspešno prestati preverjanje "
"pred zaključkom migracije."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The next Runtime Acceptance will capture query count, database time, slow-"
"query counts and query families for origin-executed frontend probes."
msgstr ""
"Naslednja preverjanje ustreznosti delovanja zabilježit bo število poizvedb, "
"čas baze, število počasnih poizvedb in družine poizvedb za poskusi "
"uporabniškega vmesnika izvršene na izvornem strežniku."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-executor.php
msgid "The object-cache drop-in template could not be rendered safely."
msgstr "Predloga datoteke objektnega predpomnilnika ni se lahko varno pripraviti."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The old provider is deactivated only inside a transaction. YPerf then "
"reconciles ownership, proves execution, runs Runtime Acceptance, and "
"restores the previous provider automatically if proof fails."
msgstr ""
"Prejšnji ponudnik se deaktivira samo znotraj transakcije. YPerf nato uskladi"
" lastništvo, preveri izvajanje, izvede preverjanje ustreznosti delovanja in "
"ob neuspešnem preverjanju samodejno obnovi prejšnjega ponudnika."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The origin probe currently proves BYPASS, so YPerf will not claim page "
"acceleration."
msgstr ""
"Trenutni preskusni zahtevek izvornega strežnika potrjuje BYPASS pa YPerf ne "
"bo trditi da strani ubrzava predpomnilnik."

#: assets/admin.js
msgid "The original operation may still be running. Do not start it again."
msgstr "Izvorna operacija morda se še izvaja. Ne je ponovno pokretati."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"The portable MU layer provides local origin protection on standard WordPress"
" hosting. Native server and edge adapters can extend protection earlier in "
"the request path."
msgstr ""
"Prenosivi MU plast zagotavlja lokalno zaščito izvornega strežnika na "
"standardnom WordPress hostingu. Izvorni strežniški in rubni vmesniki lahko "
"proširiti zaščito na raniji del zahtevkov."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "The post-apply request set is checking public routes and safety policies."
msgstr "Nabor zahtevkov po uporabe preverja javne poti in varnostna pravila."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-responsibility-resolver.php
msgid ""
"The pre-migration W3 Total Cache responsibility settings could not be "
"restored automatically."
msgstr ""
"Nastavitve odgovornosti W3 Total Cachea pred migracije ni bilo mogoče "
"samodejno povrniti."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The previous YPerf profile is restored and the rollback Runtime Acceptance "
"completed."
msgstr ""
"Prejšnji YPerf profil povrnjen je in zaključena je preverjanje ustreznosti "
"delovanja po povrnitve."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "The previous YPerf settings are being restored and re-proved."
msgstr "Povrnejo se prejšnje YPerf nastavitve in ponovno potrjujejo."

msgid ""
"The provider is already inactive. YPerf will snapshot the remaining high-"
"confidence W3TC advanced-cache.php, retire only that artifact, run Health "
"Check, and restore the exact file automatically if proof fails."
msgstr ""
"Ponudnik je že neaktiven. YPerf bo ustvaril posnetek preostale datoteke W3TC"
" advanced-cache.php, katere lastništvo je zanesljivo potrjeno, odstranil "
"samo to datoteko, izvedel preverjanje zdravja in jo ob neuspešnem "
"preverjanju samodejno obnovil."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The provider is already inactive. YPerf will snapshot the remaining high-"
"confidence W3TC advanced-cache.php, retire only that artifact, run Runtime "
"Acceptance, and restore the exact file automatically if proof fails."
msgstr ""
"Ponudnik je že neaktiven. YPerf bo ustvaril posnetek preostale datoteke W3TC"
" advanced-cache.php, katere lastništvo je zanesljivo potrjeno, odstranil "
"samo to datoteko, zagnal preverjanje ustreznosti delovanja in jo ob "
"neuspešnem preverjanju samodejno obnovil."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "The provider responsibility could not be retired safely."
msgstr "Odgovornost ponudnika ni se lahko varno odstraniti."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-responsibility-resolver.php
msgid ""
"The provider responsibility could not be retired safely. No further "
"migration action was attempted."
msgstr ""
"Odgovornost ponudnika ni se lahko varno odstraniti. Nadaljnja migracija ni "
"poskušana."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"The provider-owned drop-in was not removed because read-back verification "
"failed."
msgstr ""
"Datoteka drop-in v upravljanju ponudnika ni bila odstranjena, ker "
"preverjanje s ponovnim branjem ni uspelo."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-executor.php
msgid ""
"The refreshed Page Cache artifact failed MISS → HIT proof and the previous "
"artifact was restored."
msgstr ""
"Osveženi artefakt Page Cache ni prestal preverjanja MISS → HIT, zato je bil "
"obnovljen prejšnji artefakt."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-executor.php
msgid ""
"The refreshed Page Cache artifact failed its read-back hash check and was "
"rolled back."
msgstr ""
"Osveženi artefakt Page Cache ni prestal preverjanja zgoščene vrednosti po "
"ponovnem branju, zato so bile spremembe povrnjene."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-executor.php
msgid ""
"The refreshed Page Cache artifact failed proof and automatic rollback could "
"not be confirmed. Stop and review before continuing."
msgstr ""
"Osveženi artefakt Page Cache ni prestal preverjanja, samodejne povrnitve pa "
"ni bilo mogoče potrditi. Pred nadaljevanjem se ustavite in preverite stanje."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The report can correlate frontend timing with WordPress, cache ownership, "
"PHP/runtime capabilities and application integrations instead of seeing only"
" the public page."
msgstr ""
"Poročilo lahko povezati čas uporabniškega vmesnika z WordPressom, "
"vlasništvom predpomnilnika, PHP možnostmi in integracijama aplikacije, "
"namesto da prikazuje samo javno stran."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-executor.php
msgid ""
"The reserved Redis database could not be re-verified immediately before "
"activation."
msgstr ""
"Rezervirana Redis baza ni se lahko ponovno potrditi neposredno pred "
"aktivacije."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-executor.php
msgid ""
"The reserved Redis database is no longer empty. YPerf stopped before writing"
" object-cache.php; release the reservation and refresh Host Intelligence."
msgstr ""
"Rezervirana Redis baza več ni prazna. YPerf je ustavil pred zapisa object-"
"cache.php; sprostite rezervacijo in osvežite podatke o strežniku."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-executor.php
msgid "The reserved Redis target failed its bounded write/read/delete proof."
msgstr ""
"Rezervirano Redis cilj ni prestalo omejeno preverjanje zapisa, branja in "
"brisanja."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-operation-contract.php
msgid ""
"The reserved logical database is no longer the empty database proven by "
"current host evidence. Release the reservation and re-evaluate instead of "
"reusing stale isolation evidence."
msgstr ""
"Rezervirana logična baza več ni ona prazna baza potrjena aktualnim podatki "
"strežnika. Sprostite rezervacijo in ponovno procijenite namesto uporabe "
"zastarjelih dokaza izolacije."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid "The restored advanced-cache.php did not match the saved rollback fingerprint."
msgstr ""
"Obnovljena datoteka advanced-cache.php se ne ujema s shranjenim prstnim "
"odtisom za povrnitev."

#: includes/class-yperf-yablonsky-ai-client.php
msgid "The reviewed Yablonsky AI User API contract is not available."
msgstr "Pregledani pogodba uporabniškega API-ja Yablonsky AI-ja ni na voljo."

#: includes/class-yperf-yablonsky-ai-client.php
msgid "The reviewed Yablonsky AI authentication contract is incomplete."
msgstr "Pregledani autentifikacijski pogodba Yablonsky AI-ja ni popoln."

#: includes/class-yperf-yablonsky-ai-client.php
msgid "The reviewed Yablonsky AI compute contract is incomplete."
msgstr "Pregledani pogodba računanja Yablonsky AI-ja ni popoln."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "The reviewed Yablonsky AI contract needs attention."
msgstr "Pregledani pogodba Yablonsky AI-ja zahteva pozor."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid "The saved W3 Total Cache advanced-cache.php could not be restored."
msgstr ""
"Shranjene datoteke advanced-cache.php v upravljanju W3 Total Cache ni bilo "
"mogoče obnoviti."

#: includes/class-yperf-yablonsky-ai-client.php
msgid "The saved Yablonsky AI credential could not be read. Save the key again."
msgstr ""
"Shranjeno poverilnico Yablonsky AI-ja ni mogoče prebrati. Ponovno shranite "
"ključ."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid "The saved legacy drop-in backup failed integrity verification."
msgstr ""
"Shranjena varnostna kopija prejšnje posebne datoteke ni prestala preverjanje"
" celovitosti."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The selected AI model is not available to this verified workspace. Refresh "
"the account catalog and choose again."
msgstr ""
"Izbrani AI model ni na voljo v tem potrjenem radnom prostoru. Osvežite "
"katalog računa in izberite ponovno."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "The selected YPerf baseline was applied and accepted by Runtime Acceptance."
msgstr ""
"Izbrane začetne nastavitve YPerfa uporabljene so in sprejete z preverjanjem "
"ustreznosti delovanja."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The selected YPerf baseline was applied, accepted by Runtime Acceptance and "
"automatically prewarmed."
msgstr ""
"Izbrane začetne nastavitve YPerfa uporabljene so, sprejete z preverjanjem "
"ustreznosti delovanja in samodejno predzagrijane."

#: includes/class-yperf-yablonsky-ai-client.php
msgid ""
"The selected Yablonsky AI text model is not available to this verified "
"workspace."
msgstr ""
"Izbrani besedilni model Yablonsky AI-ja ni na voljo v tem potrjenem radnom "
"prostoru."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The selected local profile can now be applied inside the YPerf-owned "
"WordPress boundary."
msgstr ""
"Izbrani lokalni profil zdaj se lahko uporabiti znotraj WordPress nadzora v "
"upravljanju YPerf."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "The selected settings backup is not valid JSON."
msgstr "Izbrana varnostna kopija nastavitev ni veljaven JSON."

msgid ""
"The setting changes WordPress origin delivery only. Existing external "
"Nginx/Cloudflare HTML cache entries require independent freshness "
"verification; YPerf does not silently purge host caches."
msgstr ""
"Nastavitev spreminja samo dostavo z izvornega WordPress strežnika. Obstoječi"
" HTML zapisi zunanje Nginx/Cloudflare predpomnilnika zahtevajo neovisnu "
"potrditev svežine; YPerf prikrito ne prazni predpomnilnik strežnika."

#: includes/class-yperf-settings-transfer.php
msgid "The settings backup does not contain any portable YPerf settings."
msgstr "Varnostna kopija nastavitev ne vsebuje prenosljive YPerf nastavitve."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "The settings backup is larger than the supported 256 KB safety limit."
msgstr ""
"Varnostna kopija nastavitev večja je od podprtega varnostnega omejitve od "
"256 KB."

#: includes/class-yperf-control-plane-readiness.php
msgid ""
"The site is functional, but current host/FPM headroom does not prove a "
"comfortable reserve for admin work during frontend pressure. Origin Budget "
"review should preserve an explicit control-plane reserve."
msgstr ""
"Spletno mesto deluje, vendar trenutna rezerva strežnika in PHP-FPM ne "
"potrjuje zadostne rezerve za skrbniško delo med visoko obremenitvijo "
"uporabniškega vmesnika. Pregled Origin Budget mora ohraniti izrecno rezervo "
"za upravljavsko plast."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The site is mapped to a concrete PHP-FPM pool; origin-budget recommendations"
" can now be evidence-based."
msgstr ""
"Spletno mesto povezano je z konkretnim PHP-FPM naborom; priporočila za "
"proračun izvornega strežnika zdaj se lahko temeljiti na dokazi."

#: includes/class-yperf-origin-budget-readiness.php
msgid ""
"The site pool is mapped, but no live worker RSS sample is available. Do not "
"derive an Origin Budget from configuration alone."
msgstr ""
"Nabor spletnega mesta preslikan je, vendar ni na voljo živi vzorec RSS "
"pomnilnika delovnih procesov. Ne računati Origin Budget samo iz "
"konfiguracije."

msgid "The sitemap diagnostic stayed inside its bounded execution budget."
msgstr ""
"Diagnostika zemljevidi spletnega mesta ostala je znotraj omejenega "
"vremenskog proračuna."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The stability metric is local same-origin cache evidence, not a Google "
"PageSpeed score. Use repeated PageSpeed runs later as an external field "
"check after YPerf has proved deterministic cache execution."
msgstr ""
"Merilo stabilnosti temelji na lokalnih dokazih o predpomnilniku istega "
"izvora in ni ocena Google PageSpeed. Pozneje uporabite več ponovitev "
"PageSpeed za zunanjo preverbo, potem ko YPerf potrdi deterministično "
"delovanje predpomnilnika."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-executor.php
msgid "The staged object-cache drop-in failed its read-back hash check."
msgstr ""
"Pripravljena datoteka objektnega predpomnilnika ni prestala preverjanja "
"zgoščene vrednosti po ponovnem branju."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-executor.php
msgid ""
"The stored Page Cache artifact hash does not match the live file. Refresh is"
" blocked."
msgstr ""
"Shranjeni kontrolni povzetek datoteke predpomnilnika strani ne ustreza živoj"
" datoteki. Osveževanje je blokirano."

#: includes/class-yperf-native-page-cache-operations.php
msgid ""
"The zone is exclusive to this server block. YPerf can operate prewarm now "
"while host writes remain locked."
msgstr ""
"Območje je izključna za ta blok strežnika. YPerf zdaj lahko izvajati "
"predogrevanje medtem ko zapisi na strežnik ostanejo zaklenjeni."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"Theme contrast, accessibility styling and third-party scripts such as chat "
"widgets remain outside this write boundary. YPerf may diagnose those costs "
"later, but this campaign does not rewrite external code just to improve a "
"benchmark score."
msgstr ""
"Kontrast teme, slogovne prilagoditve dostopnosti in skripte tretjih oseb, "
"kot so klepetalni gradniki, niso vključeni v te spremembe. YPerf lahko "
"pozneje diagnosticira njihove stroške, vendar ta kampanja ne spreminja "
"zunanje kode zgolj zaradi boljše primerjalne ocene."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Think of it as PageSpeed Insights with access under the hood."
msgstr "Zamislite PageSpeed Insights z pogledom pod haube."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "This YPerf capability is operated from its dedicated bounded workflow."
msgstr "Tem YPerf možnostjo upravlja se skozi njen zasebni omejeni postopek."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This completed migration remains visible as history. Future YPerf updates do"
" not ask you to migrate the same provider again."
msgstr ""
"Ta dokončana migracija ostaja vidna v zgodovine. Prihodnja posodobitve "
"YPerfa ne bo ponovno tražiti migracijo istega ponudnika."

#: includes/class-yperf-settings-transfer.php
msgid "This file is not a supported Yablonsky Performance settings backup."
msgstr "Ta datoteka ni podprta varnostna kopija nastavitev Yablonsky Performance."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This gate turns intermittent admin incidents into explicit release/tuning "
"evidence. It never raises PHP memory, changes FPM or alters the WordPress "
"upgrader automatically."
msgstr ""
"Ta preverjanje pretvara povremene administracijske incidente v izrecne "
"podatke za izdaja in nastavljanje. Nikoli samodejno ne povečuje PHP "
"pomnilnik, ne spreminja FPM ni WordPressov sistem nadgradnje."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This indicator tracks site configuration and evidence — not YPerf "
"development progress."
msgstr ""
"Ta kazalnik spremlja konfiguracijo in dokaze spletnega mesta — ne napredek "
"razvoja YPerfa."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"This is a PHP runtime capability, not something YPerf should imitate in "
"WordPress."
msgstr ""
"To je možnost PHP izvajalnega okolja, in ne nekaj kar bi YPerf trebao "
"oponašati v WordPressu."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"This is a core YPerf advantage: first-hit work is treated separately from "
"repeat-hit cache."
msgstr ""
"To je ključna prednost YPerfa: delovanje pri prvem nalaganju obrađuje se "
"ločeno od ponovljenih zadetkov predpomnilnika."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"This is a local low-risk optimization layer; it is intentionally separate "
"from cache and server adoption."
msgstr ""
"To je lokalni plast optimizacije nizkega tveganja; namerno je odvojen od "
"prevzema predpomnilnika in strežnika."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This is separate from Site Readiness. It tracks whether the detected legacy "
"provider can be retired without losing an active responsibility."
msgstr ""
"To je ločeno od pripravljenosti spletnega mesta. Spremlja, ali je mogoče "
"prejšnjega ponudnika varno odstraniti brez izgube aktivne odgovornosti."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This is the answer to “what is actually working?”. Detection alone never "
"gets a green ACTIVE state."
msgstr ""
"To ustreza na vprašanje „kar dejansko deluje?”. Samo odkrivanje nikoli ne "
"daje zeleni stanje AKTIVNO."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This is the first explicit local write boundary: YPerf may create only its "
"own wp-content/object-cache.php and namespaced Redis health/cache keys in "
"the reserved logical database."
msgstr ""
"To je prva izrecna meja lokalnega zapisovanja: YPerf lahko ustvari samo "
"lastno datoteko wp-content/object-cache.php in ključe Redis v lastnem "
"imenskem prostoru ter v rezervirani zbirki."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-responsibility-resolver.php
msgid "This provider responsibility is not supported by the guided resolver."
msgstr "Vodeni postopek ne podpira to odgovornost ponudnika."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This refresh is read-only: it rechecks the environment, runs Runtime "
"Acceptance and rebuilds the performance benchmark. It does not enable cache,"
" alter providers or change host configuration."
msgstr ""
"To osveževanje samo je za branje: ponovno preverja okolje, zažene "
"preverjanje ustreznosti delovanja in obnavlja merjenje zmogljivosti. Ne "
"vključuje predpomnilnik, ne spreminja ponudnike ni konfiguracijo strežnika."

#: includes/class-yperf-recommendations.php
msgid ""
"This site has enough published content for publishing workflow automation to"
" become relevant. A future Yablonsky Publisher integration can use YPerf "
"performance evidence without turning the cache dashboard into an advertising"
" surface."
msgstr ""
"Na tem spletnem mestu je dovolj objavljene vsebine, da je avtomatizacija "
"objavljanja smiselna. Prihodnja integracija Yablonsky Publisher lahko "
"uporablja dokaze YPerf o zmogljivosti, ne da bi nadzorno ploščo "
"predpomnilnika spremenila v oglasno površino."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This site-level view tracks optional Redis/native-host execution lanes and "
"provider-retirement evidence. It is informative and does not make optional "
"host features a market-release requirement."
msgstr ""
"Ta pogled spletnega mesta spremlja neobvezne načine izvajanja z Redis in "
"izvornim strežnikom ter dokaze o opustitvi prejšnjega ponudnika. Namenjen je"
" informiranju in ne pomeni, da so neobvezne strežniške funkcije pogoj za "
"izdajo na trg."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This snapshot proves only part of the native stack. Run the Host Inspector "
"bundled with the current YPerf release to capture site-specific Nginx "
"ownership, Redis isolation/headroom and exact PHP-FPM worker-memory "
"evidence."
msgstr ""
"Ta posnetek potrjuje samo del izvorne infrastrukture. Zaženite "
"pregledovalnik strežnika, priložen trenutni različici YPerf, da zajamete "
"lastništvo Nginx za to spletno mesto, izolacijo Redis in njegovo pomnilniško"
" rezervo ter natančne dokaze o porabi pomnilnika delovnih procesov PHP-FPM."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This tile is evidence only. YPerf does not claim ownership of an external "
"runtime layer."
msgstr ""
"Ta pločica samo je dokaz. YPerf ne tvrdi da upravlja vanjskim izvršnim "
"plastjo."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"Three frontend samples per route plus isolated Redis/Memcached localhost "
"read tests. No cache setting is changed."
msgstr ""
"Tri vzorca uporabniškega vmesnika po poti ter izolirani testovi branja "
"lokalnega Redisa/Memcacheda. Nobena nastavitev predpomnilnika ne spreminja "
"se."

