"W3 Total Cache remained active; YPerf restored the pre-handover "
"responsibility switches and did not continue."
msgstr ""
"W3 Total Cache ostao je aktiven; YPerf je povrnil stikala odgovornosti na "
"stanje pred predaje in ni nastavio."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
