#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf enables this only when Redis isolation and memory headroom are safe. "
"It is never forced just to increase a feature count."
msgstr ""
"YPerf to omogoči le, kadar sta izolacija Redis in razpoložljivi pomnilnik "
"varna. Funkcija se nikoli ne vklopi zgolj zato, da bi povečali število "
"funkcij."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf first captures a fresh read-only baseline, then applies the selected "
"local profile and immediately repeats Runtime Acceptance. A preflight FAIL "
"makes no changes; a post-apply FAIL restores the previous profile "
"automatically."
msgstr ""
"YPerf najprej ustvari sveže izhodiščno stanje samo za branje, nato uporabi "
"izbrani lokalni profil in takoj ponovi preverjanje ustreznosti delovanja. Če"
" predhodno preverjanje ne uspe, ni sprememb; če preverjanje po uporabi ne "
"uspe, YPerf samodejno obnovi prejšnji profil."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-adoption.php
msgid ""
"YPerf has a current local reservation for the isolated Redis target. No "
"Redis key, drop-in or server configuration has been created."
msgstr ""
"YPerf ima trenutno lokalno rezervacijo za izolirani cilj Redis. Ustvarjen ni"
" bil noben ključ Redis, datoteka drop-in ali strežniška konfiguracija."

#: includes/class-yperf-origin-budget-adoption.php
msgid ""
"YPerf has adopted the existing PHP-FPM max_children limit as the site Origin"
" Budget. No host file was rewritten because the current native limit already"
" enforces the reviewed boundary."
msgstr ""
"YPerf je obstoječo omejitev PHP-FPM max_children prevzel kot omejitev "
"obremenitve izvornega strežnika za spletno mesto. Datoteke strežnika niso "
"bile spremenjene, ker obstoječa omejitev že zagotavlja preverjeno mejo."

#: includes/class-yperf-origin-budget-readiness.php
msgid ""
"YPerf has an exact site pool, live worker-memory evidence and current "
"Runtime Acceptance. This is enough to review a bounded Origin Budget, but "
"not enough to change FPM automatically."
msgstr ""
"YPerf ima točen identiteta nabora spletnega mesta, žive podatke o pomnilniku"
" delovnih procesov in trenutno preverjanje ustreznosti delovanja. To je "
"dovolj za pregled omejenega Origin Budgeta, vendar ne in za automatsku "
"spremembo FPM-a."

#: includes/class-yperf-origin-budget-contract.php
msgid ""
"YPerf has exact pool identity, live worker memory evidence and a control-"
"plane reserve model. R2 freezes the reviewed before-state and rollback "
"authority without editing PHP-FPM."
msgstr ""
"YPerf ima točen identiteta nabora, žive podatke o pomnilniku delovnih "
"procesov in model rezerve upravljavskega plasti. R2 zaklene pregledano "
"predhodno stanje in možnost povrnitve brez urejanja PHP-FPM-a."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "YPerf is already active"
msgstr "YPerf je že aktiven"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf is applying only allowlisted performance settings, then proving them "
"by read-back."
msgstr ""
"YPerf uporablja samo dovoljene nastavitve zmogljivosti, nato ih potrjuje "
"ponovnim odčitavanjem."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"YPerf is preserving the browser-cache responsibility when it was active at "
"the source."
msgstr ""
"YPerf hrani odgovornost predpomnilnika brskalnika če je bila aktivna v "
"izvornem sistemu."

msgid "YPerf is preserving the prepared browser-cache responsibility."
msgstr "YPerf hrani pripremljenu odgovornost predpomnilnika brskalnika."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf is purging the homepage URL through its cache authority and the "
"adopted Cloudflare purge bridge."
msgstr ""
"YPerf prazni URL začetne strani prek lastnega upravitelja predpomnilnika in "
"prevzetega Cloudflare mostu za praznjenje."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf is restoring only settings it previously changed and will not "
"overwrite unrelated external drift."
msgstr ""
"YPerf povrne samo nastavitve ki je prej spremenil in ne bo prepisati "
"nepovezane zunanje spremembe."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf is warming a bounded set of high-value public URLs so the first "
"visitor does not pay the cold-cache cost."
msgstr ""
"YPerf ogreva omejen nabor vrednih javnih URL-ova kako prvi posjetitelj ne bi"
" snosio strošek hladne predpomnilnika."

#: includes/class-yperf-environment-check.php
msgid ""
"YPerf keeps this option visible so the user can install or ask the host for "
"it later."
msgstr ""
"YPerf ohranja to možnost vidljivom da bi je uporabnik pozneje lahko "
"namestiti ali zatražiti od ponudnika hostinga."

msgid ""
"YPerf made no plugin activation changes. Review the page-cache ownership "
"state before retrying."
msgstr ""
"YPerf ni spremenil aktivacijo vtičnikov. Preglejte lastništvo predpomnilnika"
" strani pred ponovnega poskusa."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "YPerf may change"
msgstr "YPerf sme spremeniti"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf may execute only the dedicated local operations whose exact contracts "
"are shown above. Host configuration writes still require a separately "
"reviewed helper with backup, exact diff, syntax test, read-back, acceptance "
"and rollback."
msgstr ""
"YPerf sme izvesti samo namenske lokalne operacije, katerih natančne pogodbe "
"so prikazane zgoraj. Spreminjanje konfiguracije strežnika še vedno zahteva "
"ločeno pregledan pomočnik z varnostno kopijo, natančnim prikazom razlik, "
"preverjanjem skladnje, ponovnim branjem nastavitev, potrditvijo ustreznosti "
"in možnostjo povrnitve."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-adoption.php
msgid ""
"YPerf needs current read-only Redis evidence. It can use a current Host "
"Inspector snapshot or inspect a local PhpRedis service directly without "
"writing keys or changing Redis configuration."
msgstr ""
"YPerfu potrebujejo trenutni Redis dokazi samo za branje. Lahko uporabljati "
"svježu posnetek pregledovalnika strežnika ali neposredno pregledati lokalni "
"PhpRedis storitev brez zapisa ključev ali spremembe Redis konfiguracije."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "YPerf never changes"
msgstr "YPerf nikoli ne spreminja"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf object-cache drop-in was removed. Redis was not flushed or "
"reconfigured."
msgstr ""
"Datoteka objektnega predpomnilnika YPerf je bila odstranjena. Redis ni bil "
"izpraznjen ali ponovno nastavljen."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "YPerf owns only Rocket Loader OFF, HTTP/3 ON and purge synchronization."
msgstr ""
"YPerf upravlja samo Rocket Loaderom IZKLJUČENO, HTTP/3 VKLJUČENO in "
"sinkronizacijom praznjenja."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"YPerf owns the migrated layers and the post-handover Runtime Acceptance is "
"clean."
msgstr ""
"YPerf upravlja migriranim plasteh in preverjanje ustreznosti delovanja po "
"predaje uspešna je."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf owns the migrated responsibilities and post-handover Runtime "
"Acceptance is clean."
msgstr ""
"YPerf upravlja migriranim odgovornostima in preverjanje ustreznosti "
"delovanja po predaje uspešna je."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"YPerf owns the portable WordPress page-cache executor, cacheability policy, "
"selective purge, prewarm, execution proof and rollback. Native server cache "
"remains a separate adoption path."
msgstr ""
"YPerf upravlja prenosljivi mehanizem predpomnjenja strani WordPress, pravila"
" uporabe predpomnilnika, selektivno praznjenje, predhodno nalaganje, "
"preverjanje delovanja in povrnitev sprememb."

msgid ""
"YPerf owns the prepared replacement layers. Another plugin’s activation "
"status was never changed by YPerf."
msgstr ""
"YPerf upravlja pripremljenim zamjenskim plasteh. YPerf nikoli ni spreminjal "
"aktivacijski stanje drugega vtičnika."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf persistent object cache is active. Redis round-trip and Runtime "
"Acceptance passed."
msgstr ""
"YPerf trajna objektna predpomnilnik aktivna je. Redis preverjanje zapisa in "
"branja ter preverjanje ustreznosti delovanja uspešne so."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "YPerf policy"
msgstr "YPerf pravila"

msgid ""
"YPerf prepared the handoff but will not deactivate W3 Total Cache. Open "
"Plugins, deactivate W3 Total Cache yourself, return here, then continue. "
"This keeps plugin activation status under your control."
msgstr ""
"YPerf je pripravil predajo, vendar W3 Total Cache ne bo deaktiviral. Odprite"
" Vtičniki, sami deaktivirajte W3 Total Cache, vrnite se sem in nadaljujte. "
"Tako stanje aktivacije vtičnikov ostane pod vašim nadzorom."

msgid ""
"YPerf prepares a reversible handoff, then asks you to deactivate W3 Total "
"Cache yourself on the WordPress Plugins screen. After you return, YPerf "
"reconciles ownership, proves execution and runs Health Check. YPerf never "
"changes another plugin’s activation status."
msgstr ""
"YPerf pripravi povratno predajo in vas nato pozove, da W3 Total Cache sami "
"deaktivirate na zaslonu Vtičniki v WordPressu. Ko se vrnete, YPerf uskladi "
"lastništvo, preveri izvajanje in zažene preverjanje zdravja. YPerf nikoli "
"sam ne spremeni stanja aktivacije drugega vtičnika."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"YPerf preserves an OFF source intent and activates Page Cache only when that"
" responsibility actually needs a replacement."
msgstr ""
"YPerf hrani izvornu namjeru IZKLJUČENO in aktivira predpomnilnik strani samo"
" če tu odgovornost zaista treba zamenjati."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf reads the provider configuration through its public runtime API. It "
"does not change W3TC settings."
msgstr ""
"YPerf bere konfiguracijo ponudnika prek njegova javnega izvajalnega API-ja. "
"Ne spreminja W3TC nastavitve."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "YPerf reads the zone settings and effective delivery state."
msgstr "YPerf odčitava nastavitve območja in dejansko stanje dostave."

#: includes/class-yperf-native-page-cache-adoption.php
msgid ""
"YPerf recognizes the proven Nginx FastCGI cache as the authoritative page-"
"cache executor. No server configuration was changed."
msgstr ""
"YPerf prepozna potrjeno Nginx FastCGI predpomnilnik kot pristojni izvajalnik"
" predpomnilnika strani. Konfiguracija strežnika ni spremenjena."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"YPerf refused to remove advanced-cache.php because its W3 Total Cache "
"ownership changed before write time."
msgstr ""
"YPerf je zavrnil odstraniti advanced-cache.php ker se lastništvo W3 Total "
"Cachea spremenilo pred zapisa."

msgid ""
"YPerf replacement is ready; final plugin activation status remains a user "
"decision."
msgstr ""
"YPerf zamenjava pripravljena je; konačni aktivacijski stanje vtičnika ostaja"
" odločitev uporabnika."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid "YPerf response policy active"
msgstr "YPerf pravila odgovora aktivna"

msgid "YPerf restored its own changes and left plugin activation status untouched."
msgstr "YPerf je povrnil lastne spremembe in ni dirao aktivacijski stanje vtičnikov."

msgid ""
"YPerf restored its own migration changes. If you want W3 Total Cache active "
"again, reactivate it yourself from the WordPress Plugins screen."
msgstr ""
"YPerf je razveljavil lastne migracijske spremembe. Če želite ponovno "
"aktivirati W3 Total Cache, učinite to sami na WordPressovo zaslonu Vtičniki."

msgid ""
"YPerf restored its own migration changes. W3 Total Cache remains inactive "
"until the administrator chooses to reactivate it from Plugins."
msgstr ""
"YPerf je razveljavil lastne migracijske spremembe. W3 Total Cache ostaja "
"neaktiven medtem ko skrbnik ne odluči ponovno ga aktivirati v Vtičniki."

msgid ""
"YPerf restored its own partial changes. Plugin activation status remains "
"under user control."
msgstr ""
"YPerf je razveljavil lastne djelomične spremembe. Aktivacijski stanje "
"vtičnikov ostaja pod uporabniškem nadzorom."

#: includes/class-yperf-cloudflare-edge.php
msgid "YPerf restored the Cloudflare settings it had adopted."
msgstr "YPerf je povrnil Cloudflare nastavitve ki je prevzel."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"YPerf restored the previous ownership state and stopped before accepting the"
" handover."
msgstr ""
"YPerf je povrnil predhodno stanje lastništva in ustavil se pred sprejetja "
"predaje."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"YPerf restored the previous state, restored the retired W3TC responsibility "
"switches and reactivated W3 Total Cache."
msgstr ""
"YPerf je povrnil predhodno stanje, povrnil odstranjene stikala odgovornosti "
"W3TC-a in ponovno aktiviral W3 Total Cache."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"YPerf reverted every change made by this migration run, including the pre-"
"handover W3TC responsibility switches."
msgstr ""
"YPerf je razveljavil vsako spremembo v tem zagonu migracije, vključno "
"stikala odgovornosti W3TC-a pred predaje."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"YPerf reverted the partial handover and restored the pre-handover provider "
"responsibility switches before returning control."
msgstr ""
"YPerf je razveljavil djelomičnu predajo in povrnil stikala odgovornosti "
"ponudnika na predhodno stanje pred povrnitve nadzora."

msgid "YPerf rollback complete."
msgstr "Povrnitev sprememb YPerf je končana."

msgid ""
"YPerf rollback is complete. W3 Total Cache was not reactivated "
"automatically; WordPress.org requires that activation decision to remain "
"with you."
msgstr ""
"YPerf povrnitev zaključeno. W3 Total Cache ni samodejno ponovno aktiviran; "
"WordPress.org zahteva da ta odločitev ostane vaša."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "YPerf settings were imported and verified successfully."
msgstr "YPerf nastavitve uspešno so uvožene in potrjene."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"YPerf stopped after attempting the protected rollback, but one rollback "
"component could not be verified. The UI will not claim a complete rollback."
msgstr ""
"YPerf se ustavil po poskusa zaštićenog povrnitve, vendar ena komponenta "
"povrnitve ni bilo mogoče potrditi. Vmesnik ne bo trditi da je povrnitev "
"popolnoma."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"YPerf treats Redis/Valkey as bounded working memory with isolation, "
"maxmemory, hit/miss and eviction visibility."
msgstr ""
"YPerf tretira Redis/Valkey kot omejeno delovno pomnilnik z vidnost "
"izolacije, maxmemory, pogodaka/nepogodaka in izločanja."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf uses a site-specific namespace and generation-based cache invalidation"
" so rollback never requires deleting unrelated Redis data."
msgstr ""
"YPerf uporablja prostor imena specifičan za spletno mesto in generacijsko "
"razveljavitev predpomnilnika, pa povrnitev nikoli ne zahteva brisanje "
"nepovezanih Redis podatkov."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf will not activate its portable Page Cache while an adopted native "
"executor owns page-cache authority. Review or release that adoption first if"
" you intentionally want to change executors."
msgstr ""
"YPerf ne bo aktivirati svojo prenosljivo predpomnilnik strani medtem ko "
"prevzeti izvorni izvajalnik upravlja predpomnilnikom. Najprej preglejte ali "
"sprostite to prevzem če namerno želite spremeniti izvajalnik."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid "YPerf will not change an advanced-cache.php whose ownership is not proven."
msgstr ""
"YPerf ne bo spremeniti datoteko advanced-cache.php čije lastništvo ni "
"potrjeno."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"YPerf will not enable database query caching just to increase a feature "
"count. It must prove a measurable benefit beside object cache and real "
"database indexes."
msgstr ""
"YPerf ne bo uključiti predpomnjenje poizvedb v bazo podatkov samo deluje "
"povečanja števila funkcija. Mora dokazati mjerljivu korist z objektni "
"predpomnilnik in stvarne indekse baze."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf will not send a credential until the HTTPS endpoint, authentication "
"mode, workspace header and Writer transport all pass the local contract "
"gate."
msgstr ""
"YPerf ne bo poslati poverilnico medtem ko HTTPS cilj, način preverjanja "
"pristnosti, glava delovnega prostora in prenos Writer modela ne prođu "
"lokalno preverjanje pogodbe."

#: includes/class-yperf-environment-check.php
msgid "YPerf will preserve cart, checkout, account and session bypass rules."
msgstr ""
"YPerf bo ohraniti pravila zaobilaženja predpomnilnika za košarico, plačilo, "
"račun in sejo."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf will save the exact local diff and the post-apply Runtime Acceptance "
"result."
msgstr ""
"YPerf bo shraniti točne lokalne razlike in rezultat preverjanja ustreznosti "
"delovanja po uporabe."

#: includes/class-yperf-migration-journey.php
msgid "YPerf-owned replacement responsibilities were activated and proved."
msgstr "Zamjenske odgovornosti v upravljanju YPerf aktivirane so in potrjene."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "YSEO"
msgstr "YSEO"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
