#: includes/class-yperf-yablonsky-ai-client.php
msgid ""
"Yablonsky AI account verification is not available under the reviewed "
"service contract."
msgstr ""
"Preverjanje Yablonsky AI računa ni na voljo glede na pregledanem pogodbi "
"storitve."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"Yablonsky AI can analyze privacy-minimized YPerf evidence and recommend one "
"allowed local profile. AI never owns execution: deterministic safety gates "
"and your explicit Apply remain authoritative."
msgstr ""
"Yablonsky AI lahko analizira dokaze YPerf z najmanjšo možno količino "
"zasebnih podatkov in priporoči en dovoljen lokalni profil. AI nikoli ne "
"upravlja izvajanja: deterministična varnostna preverjanja in vaš izrecni "
"ukaz Uporabi ostanejo odločilni."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Yablonsky AI connection settings saved."
msgstr "Nastavitve povezovanja Yablonsky AI-ja shranjene so."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Yablonsky AI connection verified."
msgstr "Povezovanje Yablonsky AI-ja potrjeno."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"Yablonsky AI connection verified. The current workspace is ready for "
"explicit AI requests."
msgstr ""
"Povezovanje Yablonsky AI-ja potrjeno. Trenutni delovni prostor pripravljen "
"je za izrecne AI zahtevke."

#: includes/class-yperf-yablonsky-ai-client.php
