msgstr "Yablonsky AI ni povrnil uporaben besedilo Writer modela."

#: includes/class-yperf-yablonsky-ai-client.php
msgid "Yablonsky AI returned no usable text from the selected model."
msgstr "Yablonsky AI ni povrnil uporaben besedilo odabranog modela."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid "Yablonsky Performance"
msgstr "Yablonsky Performance"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"Yablonsky Performance can recommend an engine, but it never hides a slower "
"option or applies it without explicit approval."
msgstr ""
"Yablonsky Performance lahko priporoči mehanizem, vendar nikoli ne prikrije "
"počasnejše možnosti ali je uporabi brez izrecne odobritve."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"Yablonsky Performance never changes Nginx, Apache, LiteSpeed, Redis/Valkey "
"or PHP-FPM without an explicit reviewed operation. Runtime, benchmark and "
"prewarm checks are bounded and user-initiated."
msgstr ""
"Yablonsky Performance nikoli ne spreminja Nginx, Apache, LiteSpeed, "
"Redis/Valkey ali PHP-FPM brez izrecno pregledane operacije. Preverjanja "
"delovanja, primerjalne meritve in predogrevanje so omejeni in jih sproži "
"uporabnik."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid "Yablonsky Performance · Managed Early Runtime"
msgstr "Yablonsky Performance · upravljano zgodaj izvajalno okolje"

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid "Yablonsky Performance · Redis"
msgstr "Yablonsky Performance · Redis"

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid "Yablonsky Performance · Redis candidate"
msgstr "Yablonsky Performance · Redis kandidat"

#. Extracted from PHP source; i18n unification.
#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Yablonsky Performance — Runtime Acceptance"
msgstr "Yablonsky Performance — preverjanje ustreznosti delovanja"

#: includes/class-yperf-recommendations.php
msgid ""
"Yablonsky SEO was not detected. YPerf can expose performance evidence while "
"YSEO owns SEO output and can use the same site context without duplicating "
